"Disable it if you have some other plugin already converting it like WPML."
msgstr "Kapcsolja ki, ha egy másik bővítmény, például a WPML már átváltja az értékeket."

#: includes/settings/wcj-settings-multicurrency.php:139
msgid ""
"Automatically convert shipping costs to the selected currency. Keep enabled "
"unless another plugin (like WPML) is already handling shipping conversion. "
