#: includes/settings/wcj-settings-products-per-page.php:65
msgid "Position Priority"
msgstr "Pozíció prioritása"

#: includes/settings/wcj-settings-one-page-checkout.php:48
msgid ""
"Please select the possition priority for One page checkout. Set to zero to "
"use default priority."
